### Create a Test OpenAI Session
POST http://localhost:6000/api/test/create-session
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test TTS (Text-to-Speech) - Use CallSid from create-session response
# Replace TEST_1234567890 with actual test CallSid
POST http://localhost:6000/api/openai/speak/TEST_1731331200000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello! This is a test of the OpenAI text to speech system. How does it sound?"
}

###

### Get Transcripts for Test Session
# Replace TEST_1234567890 with actual test CallSid
GET http://localhost:6000/api/openai/transcripts/TEST_1731331200000

###

### Close Test Session
# Replace TEST_1234567890 with actual test CallSid
DELETE http://localhost:6000/api/test/close-session/TEST_1731331200000

###

### Get All Active Sessions (including test sessions)
GET http://localhost:6000/api/openai/sessions

###

### Complete Test Flow Example
# 1. Create session
POST http://localhost:6000/api/test/create-session

# 2. Copy the callSid from response, then test TTS
# POST http://localhost:6000/api/openai/speak/{callSid}

# 3. Check transcripts (will show TTS requests)
# GET http://localhost:6000/api/openai/transcripts/{callSid}

# 4. Close session when done
# DELETE http://localhost:6000/api/test/close-session/{callSid}

###